      "text": "Models that stop sooner accidentally protect\ntheir output. Llama keeps going and degrades.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Models that stop sooner accidentally protect\ntheir output. Llama keeps going and degrades.",
