      "text": "Models are not bad at revision. They are\nbad at deciding what needs revision.\nSpecific critique fixes it.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Models are not bad at revision. They are\nbad at deciding what needs revision.\nSpecific critique fixes it.",
