      "updated": 1718000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Akrasia framing dropped (reversibility 56%, near chance). Llama \"exception\" was an artifact (+1.02 became -0.82). \"Models can't stop\" was wrong (75% are declines). All old numbers superseded.",
