      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Results section drafted. Findings lead,\n   meta-commentary moved to methods.\n\n2. Regenerate all figures on the corrected\n   pipeline (6->2 recode, GENUINE filter,\n   stripped scores as primary).\n\n3. Update cost estimates to 2026 API pricing.\n\n4. NEED EMAMI'S READ:\n   - Does this framing work?\n   - Is the cliff strong enough?\n     (n=50, 90% from Llama)\n   - Is the decline phenomenon more\n     interesting than the quality cliff?\n\n5. Appendix: Studies 1 and 2 unchanged.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Results section drafted. Findings lead,\n   meta-commentary moved to methods.\n\n2. Regenerate all figures on the corrected\n   pipeline (6->2 recode, GENUINE filter,\n   stripped scores as primary).\n\n3. Update cost estimates to 2026 API pricing.\n\n4. NEED EMAMI'S READ:\n   - Does this framing work?\n   - Is the cliff strong enough?\n     (n=50, 90% from Llama)\n   - Is the decline phenomenon more\n     interesting than the quality cliff?\n\n5. Appendix: Studies 1 and 2 unchanged.",
